      "journeyUsed": false,
      "answer": "When you're short on time, consider cooking simple meals like scrambled eggs, toast with avocado, or a quick stir-fry with pre-cut vegetables and a protein source like beans or chicken. These meals can be prepared and cooked within 15-20 minutes. If you have even less time, look for pre-cooked or ready-to-eat options like soups or salads.",
